<title>MEXICO: Penoles to pay dividend of 1.36 pesos.</title>
<headline>Penoles to pay dividend of 1.36 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrias Penoles, the world's largest refined silver producer, said on Thursday it will pay a cash dividend of 1.36 pesos per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement to the Mexican Stock Exchange that it had not yet set a date for paying the dividend.  It said it had 404,494,747 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The firm said also that its recent shareholders' meeting approved creating reserves of 200 million pesos to buy back company shares.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
